# ==============================================================================
# Database: Open TCP Port OS Fingerprinting & Service Detection
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Field Schema:
#   Port | Max TTL | OS / Service Label | Score (1-99) | Device Type | Vendor
#
# Rules for Adding Entries:
#   1. Strict Sorting: Port (ASC) -> TTL (ASC: 64 -> 128 -> 255).
#   2. TTL Hierarchy: Put Linux/BSD (TTL <= 64) BEFORE Windows (TTL <= 128) 
#      and Router/Appliance (TTL <= 255). The parser breaks on the 1st match!
#   3. Device Type tokens: pc, server, smartphone, console, smart-tv, 
#      smart-speaker, printer, iot, router, generic.
#
# Example:
#   80|64|HTTP Service (TTL64)|45|generic|Unknown
#   80|128|HTTP Service (TTL128)|45|generic|Unknown
# ==============================================================================
